{"seq":3,"slug":"game-ai","title":"游戏 AI","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai","rating":{"composite":3.97,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏-ai-简介\">游戏 AI 简介</h1><p>游戏 AI 赋予游戏中的非玩家角色（NPC）以&quot;智能&quot;，让它们能够寻路导航、做出决策、展现个性化行为，甚至生成全新的游戏内容。优秀的游戏 AI 能够显著提升玩家的沉浸感和游戏的可玩性。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于有编程基础、希望掌握游戏 AI 核心技术的开发者。无论你是在制作策略游戏、动作游戏还是开放世界游戏，这里涵盖的技术都能为你的 AI 系统提供坚实的理论和实践指导。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>寻路系统</strong>讲解游戏中最基础也最关键的 AI 能力——路径规划，从图搜索基础算法到 A* 寻路，再到导航网格和动态寻路技术，系统覆盖角色在复杂环境中的自主导航。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>决策系统</strong>介绍 AI 角色&quot;思考&quot;的核心框架，涵盖有限状态机、行为树、效用 AI 和目标导向行动规划等主流决策架构，帮助你为不同类型的游戏选择合适的决策方案。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>NPC 行为</strong>聚焦于 AI 角色在游戏世界中的具体表现，包括转向行为、感知系统、小队战术以及个性模型，让 NPC 的行为从机械执行进化为有&quot;灵魂&quot;的表演。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>程序化生成</strong>探索 AI 在内容创作方面的应用，涵盖噪声算法、地牢生成、基于规则的生成系统以及机器学习在游戏 AI 中的前沿应用，展示如何用算法创造无限的游戏内容。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：建议从第1章寻路系统入手掌握最基础的 AI 能力，然后学习第2章决策系统建立 AI 架构思维，接着通过第3章深化对 NPC 行为的理解，最后探索第4章的程序化生成技术。各章内容相对独立，也可根据项目需要灵活选择学习顺序。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pathfinding","title":"寻路系统","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/pathfinding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-search-basics","title":"图搜索基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/pathfinding/graph-search-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-star-algorithm","title":"A\\* 寻路算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/pathfinding/a-star-algorithm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"navigation-mesh","title":"导航网格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/pathfinding/navigation-mesh"},{"seq":4,"slug":"dynamic-pathfinding","title":"动态寻路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/pathfinding/dynamic-pathfinding"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"decision-systems","title":"决策系统","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/decision-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"finite-state-machine","title":"有限状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/decision-systems/finite-state-machine"},{"seq":2,"slug":"behavior-tree","title":"行为树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/decision-systems/behavior-tree"},{"seq":3,"slug":"utility-ai","title":"效用 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/decision-systems/utility-ai"},{"seq":4,"slug":"goal-oriented-action","title":"目标导向行动规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/decision-systems/goal-oriented-action"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"npc-behavior","title":"NPC 行为","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/npc-behavior","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"steering-behaviors","title":"转向行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/npc-behavior/steering-behaviors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"perception-system","title":"感知系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/npc-behavior/perception-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"squad-tactics","title":"小队战术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/npc-behavior/squad-tactics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"personality-model","title":"个性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/npc-behavior/personality-model"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"procedural-generation","title":"程序化生成","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/procedural-generation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"noise-algorithms","title":"噪声算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/procedural-generation/noise-algorithms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dungeon-generation","title":"地牢生成算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/procedural-generation/dungeon-generation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rule-based-generation","title":"基于规则的生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/procedural-generation/rule-based-generation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"ml-in-game-ai","title":"机器学习在游戏 AI 中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai/procedural-generation/ml-in-game-ai"}]}]}